der; it is stored as the catalog PDD pocket audio recorder row. Four additional E-clips for each of two weapons is 8 E-clips. NOT STORED: a suit of custom-made light (30 M.D.C.) to medium (50 M.D.C.) body armor, which may or may not be environmental, and two modern weapons of choice; neither names an item. No money is printed. || NOT STORED: size 6-7 feet, weight 160 to 230 pounds, life span 80-100 years, allies, enemies and habitat are in GM Notes. The three scent abilities are natural ability text with their percentages. The -10% to swimming skills is a side effect line."
